or id="rbrhd"/>- 84.</xref> An Salzmann, Sessenheim 5. 6. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrHE)"><anchor id="rbrhe"/>- 85.</xref> An Salzmann, Sessenheim 12. 6. 1771?; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrHF)"><anchor id="rbrhf"/>- 86.</xref> An Salzmann, Sessenheim 19. 6. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrHG)"><anchor id="rbrhg"/>- 87.</xref> An Langer, Straßburg 8. 8. 1771</p>
