          <p id="jg80552"><milestone ed="foliogruppe" unit="JGoethe 1771- Mai 72"/><hi>Briefe</hi>: <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrHH)"><anchor id="rbrhh"/>- 88.</xref> An das Schöffengericht zu Frankfurt, Frankfurt 28. 8. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrHI)"><anchor id="rbrhi"/>- 89.</xref> An Johann Gottfried Roederer, 21. 9. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIX)"><anchor id="rbrix"/>- 90.</xref> An Herder, Frankfurt ?. 9. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIA)"><anchor id="rbria"/>- 91.</xref> An Herder, Frankfurt ?. 9. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIB)"><anchor id="rbrib"/>- 92.</xref> An Salzmann, Frankfurt ?. 10. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIC)"><anchor id="rbric"/>- 93.</xref> An Herder, Frankfurt etwa 10. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrID)"><anchor id="rbrid"/>- 94.</xref> An Salzmann, 28. 11. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIE)"><anchor id="rbrie"/>- 95.</xref> An Salzmann, Frankfurt ?. 12. 1771; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIF)"><anchor id="rbrif"/>- 96.</xref> An Herder, Frankfurt Anfang 1772; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIG)"><anchor id="rbrig"/>- 97.</xref> An Salzmann, 3. 2. 1772; <xref doc="JGOETHE1" from="id (BrIH)"><anchor id="rbrih"/>- 98.</xref> An Johann Heinrich Jung, Frankfurt 3. 2. 1772</p>
